        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "sq_augmented_race_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Jack in — run the rings again",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/augmented_race/start {ticks:900}"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "start_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Later",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "There they are. The one who cleared the whole ring stack in one breath. The rig logged your run and I have been showing it to everyone who climbs up here. Nobody believes me. Run it again and I will have proof."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You ran the augment clean. That is the whole grid, thirty-seven hoops, top of my antennas to the plaza floor and back up. Anyone can fall off a roof. Falling off a roof on PURPOSE and landing right — that is the trick, and you have it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The rig is charged whenever you want another lap. No wager, no reward the second time — just the run and the clock. Some people come up here just to feel it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Arlo Datagear — you ran the rings",
                    Label: "done"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Jack in — run the rings",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/augmented_race/start {ticks:900}"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "start_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not today",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You move like someone who has been falling off things all your life and getting up. Good — I have a rig for anyone who wants it, no badge required. Speed in the legs, spring in the knees, and a course of light-rings threaded down the whole tower stack. Crouch as you hit a roof and you roll instead of splatting. Run the rings, ring to ring, before the rig winds down."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "This is my augment rig. It juices your legs and your jump so you can chase a run of light-hoops from my antenna deck all the way to the plaza and back up. The catch is the fall — so remember: crouch the instant you land and you roll it off instead of breaking your legs. Ready when you are."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Everyone else up here browns out worrying about the grid. I built a game out of it. Thirty-seven rings, all the way down the towers and back to me. The rig makes you fast and lets you jump — hold crouch as you touch down and the fall never touches you. Ring to ring, beat the clock."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Arlo Datagear — the augment rig",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
